# What npm installs from package-lock.json.
/node_modules/
# What `just build` writes: the build of the app, which `vite preview` serves.
/build/
# The files of a release, which `just release-files` writes (T29 in RUN.md).
/dist/
# What `just ci-test` writes: the coverage report the shared typescript.yml sends to Codecov.
/coverage/
# What tsc keeps between runs.
*.tsbuildinfo
# The screenshots Vitest takes of a failed test in the browser: Vitest 5 puts them under .vitest/.
__screenshots__/
/.vitest/
# The deployment configuration of a local run: the parameters of a Firebase project of the
# author's own, which stay on the machine (section 3.7 of docs/architecture.md).
/deployment.local.json
